    "question": "What is The Skin & Glow?",
    "answer": "The Skin & Glow is Eden's clinician-guided protocol combining KPV, Sermorelin, and Glutathione for inside-out skin, collagen, inflammatory-balance, and antioxidant support."
  },
  {
    "question": "Is this the same as the GLOW Stack I have seen elsewhere?",
    "answer": "Not exactly. Community GLOW formulas often refer to BPC-157, TB-500, and GHK-Cu. Eden's The Skin & Glow uses KPV, Sermorelin, and Glutathione per Eden's clinical brief."
  },
  {
    "question": "Will this replace my topicals or aesthetic treatments?",
    "answer": "No. The Skin & Glow is designed to complement topical skincare and aesthetic treatments, not replace them."
  },
  {
    "question": "Can it stack with injectables, lasers, or microneedling?",
    "answer": "Often, yes. Eden reviews timing, compatibility, and your full aesthetic plan during consultation."
  },
  {
    "question": "How soon do people notice changes?",
    "answer": "Skin feel and reactivity may shift within weeks, while visible texture, tone, and collagen-related changes usually take longer. Individual response varies."
  },
  {
    "question": "How is eligibility determined?",
    "answer": "Through consultation, medical history, medication review, skin goals, and provider review."
  },
  {
    "question": "Is it prescribed?",
    "answer": "When prescription components are appropriate, Eden uses licensed medical oversight and licensed pharmacy fulfillment."
  },
  {
    "question": "Is it FDA-approved?",
    "answer": "The components in this protocol are not presented as FDA-approved drugs for this use. Eligibility is determined during consultation."
  },
  {
    "question": "Is this available in Greenwood Village?",
    "answer": "Yes. Eden serves Greenwood Village, DTC, Cherry Hills Village, Centennial, Englewood, Littleton, and the broader south Denver metro."
  },
  {
    "question": "What happens after the consult?",
    "answer": "If you are a fit, Eden designs the protocol, coordinates it with your aesthetic plan, and sets follow-up expectations."
  }
